 In MongoDB, individual data records are stored as 'documents' formatted in BSON (Binary JSON), analogous to rows in relational databases.

 A collection in MongoDB is a group of related documents, analogous to a table in relational database management systems.
 
 Mongoose is the standard Object Data Modeling (ODM) library for MongoDB and Node.js, providing schema validation, model definitions, and database connection utilities.


